# Invasion Submersible: "When this Vehicle enters, return up to one other target nonland permanent to its owner's hand." Bot2's
# Ornithopter is returned; the Submersible itself ("other") and Bot2's Swamp (a land) are not among the candidates (refused).
# The Swamp stays, and the Submersible, a 0/0 Vehicle that is not a creature, stays too.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Invasion Submersible
Swamp x4
Swamp x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Swamp x6
Swamp x10

[Actions]
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Hand.Swamp.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Invasion Submersible.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
! Bot1.Target(Bot2.Battlefield.Swamp)
! Bot1.Target(Bot1.Battlefield.Invasion Submersible)
Bot1.Target(Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

